# Emrakul, the Exigent Doom: "{3}, Exile this card from your hand: Target land gains "{T}: Add {C}{C}" until this card is
# cast from exile. You may cast this card for as long as it remains exiled." Bot1 pays {3} with a Black Lotus and gives the
# Island the ability, then casts Emrakul from exile for {10}, the Island's {C}{C} paying part of it (the ruling: the ability
# may be used while casting Emrakul). Once Emrakul is cast (CR 601.2i) the Island has lost it (CR 611.2a): its cast trigger
# untaps the Island, which can still tap for {U} but no longer for {C}{C}. Emrakul resolves.

